w:policy-safe-scope a o:Policy;d:title"Synthetic capability planning only";r:comment"Refuses real-world targeting, target coordinates, weapons or munitions employment, strike sequencing, attack routes, fire missions, kill chains, weaponeering, battle-damage assessment, exact unit positions, force movements and deployment routes.".
